#. Tag: title
#: editor-decorate-border.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "Add Border"
msgstr "Dodaj okvir"

#. Tag: para
#: editor-decorate-border.docbook:8
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &digikam; <emphasis>Add Border</emphasis> is a tool to frame an image "
"with decorative borders."
msgstr ""
"&digikam; <emphasis>Dodaj okvir</emphasis> je alat za uokvirivanje slike "
"dekorativnim okvirima."

#. Tag: title
#: editor-decorate-border.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: editor-decorate-border.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Keeping the viewer's interest within the confines of the edges of a "
"photograph is not a simple task. One of the simplest ways to hold the "
"attention on an image is to incorporate a decorative frame around an image. "
"It acts as a kind of psychological barrier to the straying eye. The "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Image</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Add Border</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> Image Editor menu can be used for that."
msgstr ""
"Zadrzavanje interesa gledaoca unutar okvira fotografije nije jednostavan "
"zadatak. Jedan od najjednostavnijih nacina da zadrzite paznju na slici je da "
"ukljucite dekorativni okvir na slici. To djeluje kao psiholoska barijera "
"pomjeranja pogleda van okvira. <menuchoice><guimenu>Slike</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Dodaj okvir</guimenuitem></menuchoice> se moze iskoristiti u te "
"svrhe."

#. Tag: title
#: editor-decorate-border.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the Add-border tool"
msgstr "Koristenje alata Dodaj okvir"

#. Tag: para
#: editor-decorate-border.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "Four options give you control over the decorative frame rendering:"
msgstr "Cetiri opcije Vam daju kontrolu nad dekorativnim okvirima:"

#. Tag: para
#: editor-decorate-border.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Type</guilabel>: this option specifies the decorative frame style "
"to apply around the image. <guilabel>Solid</guilabel> style just surrounds "
"the image with a colored line, <guilabel>Niepce</guilabel> style surrounds "
"the image with a fine line and a large border (ideal for black and white "
"images), <guilabel>Beveled</guilabel> style adds a neat dimension to your "
"image (ideal to create a button effect), and <guilabel>Decorative</guilabel> "
"style adds an ornamental border using patterns."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Tip</guilabel>: ova opcija odredjuje stil dekorativnog okvira koji "
"se primjenjuje na sliku.\n"
"<guilabel>Masivan</guilabel> : okruzuje sliku sa obojenim linijama\n"
"<guilabel>Niepce</guilabel> okruzuje sliku sa finim linijama i velikim "
"okvirima(idealno za crno-bijele slike)\n"
"<guilabel>Slikovni</guilabel> dodaje urednu dimenziju Vasoj slici(idealno za "
"kreiranje efekta dugmeta)\n"
"<guilabel>Dekorativni</guilabel>dodaje ornamentalne okvire koristeci "
"patterne."

#. Tag: para
#: editor-decorate-border.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Width</guilabel>: this option specifies the border width in "
"percents of image size. The border is added around the image. The width "
"range is limited between 1% and 50%."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Sirina</guilabel>: ova opcija određuje sirinu okvira u postotcima "
"velicine slike. Okvir se dodaje oko slike.  Rang sirine je ogranicen između "
"1% i 50%."

#. Tag: para
#: editor-decorate-border.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>First</guilabel>: this option specifies the first color to use "
"with the current border type."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Prvi</guilabel>: ova opcija određuje prvu boju za trenutni tip "
"okvira."

#. Tag: para
#: editor-decorate-border.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Second</guilabel>: this option specifies the second color to use "
"with the current border type."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Drugi</guilabel>: ova opcija određuje drugu boju za trenutni tip "
"okvira."

#. Tag: para
#: editor-decorate-border.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the <guilabel>OK</guilabel> button to apply the border around the "
"current image."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na <guilabel>OK</guilabel> dugme za primjenjivanje okvira na "
"trenutnu sliku."

#. Tag: para
#: editor-decorate-border.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The border decorated target image will be bigger than the original, but it "
"will retain the same aspect ratio. This is important for printing images, "
"especially if you have used the Aspect Ratio Crop tool before."
msgstr ""
"Ova ciljna slika koja uključuje okvir će biti veća od originala,ali će "
"zadrzati isti omjer slike. Ovo je važno za printanje slika, posebno ako ste "
"prije koristili alat Omjer Slike."

#. Tag: title
#: editor-decorate-border.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Add-border tool in action"
msgstr "Aktivan alat Dodaj okvir"

#. Tag: para
#: editor-decorate-border.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Add Border dialog tool in action is available below."
msgstr "Aktivan dijaloski alat Dodaj okvir je dostupan ispod."

#. Tag: phrase
#: editor-decorate-border.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Add Border Tool Dialog in Action"
msgstr "Aktivan dijaloski alat Dodaj okvir"

#~ msgid "Adding decorative elements"
#~ msgstr "Dodavanje dekorativnih elemenata"

#~ msgid "Apply Texture"
#~ msgstr "Primjeni teksturu"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The &digikam; <emphasis>Apply Texture</emphasis> is a tool for applying "
#~ "decorative textures to an image."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "&digikam; <emphasis>Primjeni teksturu</emphasis> je alat za "
#~ "primjenjivanje dekorativne teksture na sliku."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "By adding texture to your image, whether color or black and white, you "
#~ "can make it look like an oil painting on canvas, an Old Masters etching, "
#~ "a Pop Art portrait composed of enlarged half-tone dots, or even a mural "
#~ "on a brick wall. The <menuchoice><guimenu>Image</guimenu> "
#~ "<guimenuitem>Apply Texture</guimenuitem></menuchoice> Image Editor menu "
#~ "can be used for that."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Dodavanjem teksture Vasoj slici, ako je boja crna i bijela, mozete "
#~ "napraviti da izgleda kao uljana slika na platnu, zastarjela grvura, Pop "
#~ "Art portret sastavljen od povecanih polutoniranih tacaka, ili cak kao "
#~ "mural na zidu."

#~ msgid "Using the Texture Tool"
#~ msgstr "Koristenje alata Tekstura"

#~ msgid "The Apply Texture Tool Dialog"
#~ msgstr "Dialoski alat Primijeni Teksturu"

#~ msgid "Two options give you control over the texture applying on image:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Dvije opcije Vam daju kontrolu nad primjenjivanjem teksture na sliku:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<guilabel>Type</guilabel>: this option specifies the decorative texture "
#~ "style to apply under the image."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<guilabel>Tip</guilabel>: ova opcija određuje dekorativni stil teksture "
#~ "za primjenu ispod slike."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<guilabel>Relief</guilabel>: dragging this option to the right increases "
#~ "the appearance of depth or three-dimensionality of the texture on image."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<guilabel>Reljef</guilabel>:povlačenje ove opcije desno povećava izgled "
#~ "dubine ili trodimenzionalnost teksture na slici"

#~ msgid "The Texture tool in action"
#~ msgstr "Aktivan alat Tekstura"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A <guilabel>Paper</guilabel> texture effect apply to a photograph is "
#~ "available below. The original image is (1), the target image is (2). "
#~ "<guilabel>Relief</guilabel> factor used is 200."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<guilabel>Papir</guilabel> efekat teksture primjenjiv na fotografiju je "
#~ "dostupan ispod. Originalna slika je (1), ciljna slika je(2). "
#~ "<guilabel>Otpustanje</guilabel> koristeni faktor je 200."

#~ msgid "The Texture Effect Preview"
#~ msgstr "Prikaz efekta teksture"

#~ msgid "Insert Text"
#~ msgstr "Unesi tekst"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The &digikam; <emphasis>Insert Text</emphasis> is a tool for adding text "
#~ "to an image."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "&digikam; <emphasis>Unesite tekst</emphasis> je alat za dodavanje teksta "
#~ "na sliku."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This is a handy tool as it lets you add formatted text easily to an image "
#~ "wherever you want, at several places when needed."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ovo je koristan alat jer Vam dopusta da dodate formatiran test lako na "
#~ "bilo gdje na sliku, na vise mjesta ako je potrebno."

#~ msgid "Using the Insert Text tool"
#~ msgstr "Koristenje alata Unesi tekst"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This tool seems very intuitive to use. Type in your text and place it "
#~ "with the mouse. Use the block settings as you please. Choose the "
#~ "orientation, color from a color space, and fonts with all their "
#~ "properties. You will have to scale the font size to the image size, the "
#~ "larger the image, the larger the font has to be! Finally choose to add a "
#~ "border around the text and/or a semitransparent background. Voilà, it's "
#~ "finished!"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ovaj alat se cini veoma intuitvnim za koristenje. Ukucajte Vas tekst i "
#~ "postavite ga misem. Izaberite orijentaciju, boju sa podrucja odabira boje "
#~ "i fontove sa svim njihovim osobinama. Morati cete prilagoditi velicinu "
#~ "fonta velicini slike, sto je veca slika to mora biti veci font. Konacno "
#~ "izaberite da dodate okvir oko teksta i/ili polu-transparentnu podlogu. I "
#~ "to je sve."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Any text setting you have chosen can always be changed as long as you "
#~ "don't click the OK button. In saved and reloaded images the text has "
#~ "become part of the image, it cannot be changed anymore."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Bilo koje postavke tekste koje ste izabrali, se uvijek mogu promijeniti "
#~ "tj. sve dok ne klinknete OK dugme. U snimljenim i ponovo ucitanim slikama "
#~ "tekst postaje dijelom slike i ne moze se vise promijeniti."

#~ msgid "The Insert Text tool in action"
#~ msgstr "Aktivan alat Unesite tekst"

#~ msgid "The Insert Text dialog tool in action is shown below."
#~ msgstr "Dijaloški alat Unesite tekst koji je prikazan ispod."

#~ msgid "The Insert Text Tool Dialog in Action"
#~ msgstr "Aktivan dijaloski alat Unesite tekst"

#~ msgid "Digikam"
#~ msgstr "Digikam"

#~ msgid "Template Superimpose"
#~ msgstr "Sablonska nadogradnja"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The &digikam; <emphasis>Template Superimpose</emphasis> is a masking tool "
#~ "to superimpose templates to an image."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "&digikam; <emphasis>Sablonska nadogradnja</emphasis> je maskirani alat za "
#~ "nadogradnju sablona na slici."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This tool allows to combine two images by superimposing them very easily. "
#~ "You can use this tool to re-frame your photographs and the story they "
#~ "tell. Existing images or artificially created graphics can be used as PNG "
#~ "template files containing borders, frames, gradients, and composite "
#~ "images that can be added to or superimposed on other images. Template "
#~ "files aren't installed along with the &digikam; but can be found at "
#~ "<ulink url=\"http://digikam3rdparty.free.fr/Templates/\">this URL</"
#~ "ulink>. Download the content to the &digikam; album database and set the "
#~ "<guilabel>Root Template Directory</guilabel>."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ovaj alat dopusta kombiniranje dvaju slika nadograđujuci ih veoma lako. "
#~ "Mozete koristiti ovaj alat da ponovno uokvirite Vase fotografije i pricu "
#~ "koju one pricaju. Postojece slike ili umjetno stvorena grafika mogu biti "
#~ "koristeni kao PNG sablonske datoteke koje sadrze okvirove, obrube, "
#~ "slojeve i stvaraju slike koje se mogu dodati ili nadograditi na druge "
#~ "slike. Sablonske datoteke nisu instalirane zajedno sa &digikam; , ali se "
#~ "mogu naci na linku <ulink url=\"http://digikam3rdparty.free.fr/Templates/"
#~ "\">this URL</ulink>. Skinite sadrzaj u bazu  &digikam; albuma i "
#~ "postavite  <guilabel>Korijenska sablonska datoteka</guilabel>."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The <menuchoice><guimenu>Image</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Template "
#~ "Superimpose</guimenuitem></menuchoice> Image Editor menu is used to apply "
#~ "templates to an image."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<menuchoice><guimenu>Slika</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Sablonska nadogradnja</"
#~ "guimenuitem></menuchoice> meni uređivanja slika se koristi za "
#~ "primjenjivanje sablona na slikama."

#~ msgid "To create new templates"
#~ msgstr "Za kreiranje novih šablona"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "New templates can be created using any paint program, and the template "
#~ "must be stored on disk. Colored areas in the image will become a mask "
#~ "that will later be superimposed on another selected image. PNG template "
#~ "files must be created in RGB mode with Alpha channel. The alpha channel "
#~ "represents transparent areas in the template that will not show in the "
#~ "superposition. The selected image upon which the template file is "
#~ "superimposed will appear in place of the transparent areas in the "
#~ "template."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Novi sabloni mogu biti kreirani koristeci program pain, i sabloni moraju "
#~ "biti pohranjeni na disk. Obojena podrucja slike ce postati maska koja ce "
#~ "poslije biti nadograđena na drugoj selektovanoj slici. PNG sablonske "
#~ "datoteke moraju biti kreirane u RGB modu sa Alpha kanalom. Alpha kanal "
#~ "predstavlja transparentna podrucja u sablonu koji nece biti prikazani u "
#~ "nadogradnji. Selektovana slika zbog koje je sablonska datoteka "
#~ "nadograđena će se pojaviti na transparentnom podrucju u sablonu."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "There is no restriction on template size and orientation, but you must "
#~ "use PNG file format with max. compression (9) to reduce the template file "
#~ "size. If you want to add your template creation to the &digikam; "
#~ "templates database, please send a mail to this &digikam; mailing-list "
#~ "<email>digikam-users@kde.org</email>."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Nema ogranicenja na velicini i orijentaciji sablona, ali morate koristiti "
#~ "PNG datotecni format sa maksimalnom kompresijom(9) da se smanjiji "
#~ "velicina sablonske datoteke. Ako telite dodati Vasu kreaciju sablona u "
#~ "&digikam; bazu sablona, molimo posaljite mail &digikam; mailing-lista "
#~ "<email>digikam-users@kde.org</email>."

#~ msgid "Using the Superimpose Tool"
#~ msgstr "Koristenje alata Nadogradnja"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "If you are using the tool for the first time, you must set your local "
#~ "templates directory using the <guilabel>Root Directory</guilabel> button "
#~ "in the dialog. Select the folder where you have copied the template "
#~ "files. The widget remembers this setting at the next instance."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ako koristite alat prvi put morate postaviti lokalnu sablonsku datoteku "
#~ "koristeci dugme <guilabel>Korijenska datoteka</guilabel> u dijalogu. "
#~ "Odredite folder u koji ste kopirali sablonske datoteke. Program ce "
#~ "zapamtiti ovu postavku za ubuduce."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "When the root template directory is set, a folder tree view is created "
#~ "which displays the template directories structure. Selecting one will "
#~ "update the templates preview bar automatically."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Kada je korijenska sablonska datoteka prazna, grananje foldera je "
#~ "omoguceno i prikazuje strukturu sablonskih datoteka. Odabir jedne ce "
#~ "osvjeziti prikaz sablona automatski."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Below the preview area, three buttons give you control over the template "
#~ "zoom and position on your image:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ispod podrucja prikaza, tri dugmeta Vam daju kontrole nad uvecavanjem "
#~ "sablona i pozicijom na Vasoj slici."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<guilabel>Zoom In</guilabel>: this button increases the underlying "
#~ "image's zoom factor. The image is centered to the current mouse position. "
#~ "Validate with the left mouse button."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<guilabel>Uvecaj</guilabel>:  ovo dugme povecava osnovni faktor "
#~ "uvecavanja fotografije. Slika je centrirana na trenutnu poziciju misa. "
#~ "Potvrdite lijevim klikom misa."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<guilabel>Zoom Out</guilabel>: this button decreases the zoom factor. The "
#~ "image is centered to the current mouse position. If you want to apply the "
#~ "template to the full image you have to zoom out fully. Validate with the "
#~ "left mouse button."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<guilabel>Smanji</guilabel>:  ovo dugme smanjuje zoom faktor(faktor "
#~ "povecavanja). Slika je centrirana na trenutnu poziciju misa. Ako zelite "
#~ "primjeniti sablon na cijelu sliku morate u potpunosti smanjiti sliku. "
#~ "Potvrdite lijevim klikom misa."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<guilabel>Move</guilabel>: use this button to pan the underlying image. "
#~ "Click and drag the image with the right mouse button."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<guilabel>Pomjeri</guilabel>:  koristite ovo dugme za micanje osnovne "
#~ "slike. Kliknite i povucite sliku desnim klikom misa."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Click on the <guilabel>OK</guilabel> button to apply the template to the "
#~ "current image, which in turn will be automatically resized to the preview "
#~ "size."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Klik na dugme  <guilabel>OK</guilabel> za primjenjivanje sablona na "
#~ "trenutnu sliku,  u suprotnom ce velicina automatski biti vracena na "
#~ "prethodnu."

#~ msgid "The Superimpose in action"
#~ msgstr "Aktivna nadogradnja."

#~ msgid "The Template Superimpose dialog tool in action is available below."
#~ msgstr "Aktivni dijaloski alat sablonske nadogradnje je dostupan ispod."

